A||N||4||terryk||86 SE 4->5 spd Isuzu - What flywheel?||||1||
Z||000000||terryk||06-12-2001||12:47 AM||||A friend wants to convert his 86 4spd to a 5 spd Isuzu. If I use the clutch and trans from an 87 4 banger, what flywheel do I need? He's not a racer so it just needs to work correctly, not survive clutch drops.<P>The reason I ask is that he has an 87 SE 4 banger with very low miles and a new clutch to steal the trans/cable/shifters from.<P>Also, do the 5 spd Isuzu cables clear the exhaust system?<P>Thanks for the help.||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrfiero||06-12-2001||01:15 AM||||The clutch belongs to the tranny and the flywheel belongs to the engine.  That said, you need to use a V-6 flywheel and the clutch for the Isuzu.<P>I have no idea about the cable question, but many people are using Isuzu 5-speeds behind a V-6 and I haven't heard of any problems.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||88CoupeV6||06-12-2001||10:57 AM||||Yes they clear. Here is an old pic of my cables. <P><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mar27^03.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>Josh <B>(known by TheFiero64 for first 1239 posts)</B><BR>     <IMG SRC="http://people.ne.mediaone.net/fiero64/Fiero642.jpg">    <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||7
Z||000003||terryk||06-12-2001||03:08 PM||||Picture's worth a thousand words! Thanks!<P>||||reg||1
Z||000004||spiz||06-12-2001||09:28 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by terryk:<BR><B>A friend wants to convert his 86 4spd to a 5 spd Isuzu. If I use the clutch and trans from an 87 4 banger, what flywheel do I need? He's not a racer so it just needs to work correctly, not survive clutch drops.<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I have no first hand knowledege of this but I have read that the v6 clutch,pressure plate, and flywheel can be used but you must use the 4cyl throwout bearing.<BR>If anyone knows for sure if this is true could you please reply. I am mating an Isuzu 5spd to a 3.4 tdc and would like to know<P>Thanks<BR>Spiz||||reg||1
